<title>JAPAN: Koito Mfg - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Koito Mfg - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 65.56		vs	   66.29</p>
<p> Operating	    1.37		vs	    1.10</p>
<p> Current		2.29		vs	    1.86</p>
<p> Net		    1.13		vs	  850    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    7.01 yen	  vs	    5.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    161 million	  vs	 160 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Koito Manufacturing Co Ltd is a major maker of car lighting equipment and is affiliated with Toyota Motor Corp.</p>
